	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-5 BARE-MODULE PAD FUNCTIONS (U3 pins 13,16,17) -- PAD13/PAD16/PAD17 functions were unverified (v8i audit: DECLARED_GAP). PARTLY CLOSED by ADR-058 s1.3: pad 13 = VTCXO - the vendor pin table docs/assets/lr2021/LoRa2021-Module-Datasheet-V1.3.pdf s7 enumerates all 18 pads and names pad 13 'VTCXO', O, 'Can provide power for an external TCXO', so the generator's placeholder 'PAD13_??' is renamed 'VTCXO' (a naming correction with a source; no connectivity added). STILL OPEN: pads 16 and 17 (PAD16_??/PAD17_??) - the vendor table calls them DIO8 and DIO7 but the generator's bare-module pin map has not been reconciled with it. See also OPEN-29 (the chip's NTC pin has no castellation)."
