	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-14 UNASSIGNED ESP32-S3 GPIO (U1 pins 20,24,25 = IO12, IO47, IO48) -- The ADR-029 pin plan does not assign these, and the strapping audit only clears IO0/IO3/IO45/IO46 as straps and IO35-IO37 as PSRAM. Left floating rather than guessed: assign them deliberately in a pin-plan revision, or mark them no_connect on the record."
