	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-16 CLAMP SET POINT (D_CLAMP) -- ADR-047 7: the clamp must conduct above the 5.4 V rail top and below the F33's damage threshold, which Rev 1.1 of the datasheet does not publish; the 12-cell array's open-circuit voltage at -60 C is also unmeasured. Part and set point cannot be finalised - do not order a guess."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 407.67 0)
