		(uuid "42f3f781-1667-57fb-8989-cc967a00b4ef")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-17 RAIL-MONITOR ADC CHANNEL (U1 pin 21 = IO13) -- ADR-047 6: IO13 is unassigned by the ADR-029 pin plan, and ADR-038 D1 makes Wi-Fi/BT never enabled (CONFIG_ESP_WIFI_ENABLED=n), which is the condition normally attached to ESP32-S3 ADC2 use. Those two facts are the whole basis for putting the monitor there. The ADC channel number and the ADC's required source impedance are NOT in this repository, and the pin plan has not yet been amended to record the assignment."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
