		(uuid "51641095-ea4f-5057-b279-dc229f7e0319")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-19 ANTENNA SOLDER ACCESS (ADR-045) -- ADR-045 does NOT change the antenna connector count or these net names: ADR-029 D3's four U.FL feeds stand, and ADR-045 gates PLACEMENT, not netlist. Its requirement is that every antenna-port pad of BOTH LoRa2021 modules, of the SX1280 and of the GNSS feed be reachable by a soldering iron from OUTSIDE the module body, enforced by tracker/hardware/tools/antenna_access_check.py (exit 0 required) before the placement freezes. ADR-045 D1 leaves the SX1280 antenna pad and the MAX-M10S RF_IN pad TODO(unverified), which is why OPEN-2 and OPEN-13 cannot be closed here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 419.1 0)
		(effects
