		(uuid "f33b0041-65c0-5d69-9906-2f2ed1190572")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-27 HUB-ARRAY BYPASS GRANULARITY (PER-CELL vs PER-GROUP) -- ADR-051 s2.2 places the hub cells on the hub and says they 'need their own diodes'; ADR-054 s4.5 explicitly leaves the hub array's per-cell-over-per-group trade OPEN.  This sheet carries the MINIMAL per-cell provision (D_HUB<n>, one SS24 across each hub cell) because scripts/bypass_diode_check.py requires every solar series group - including an on-board cell - to be covered, and a determinate answer is worth more than a silent gap.  If the trade lands on per-group, the hub diodes regroup and this note is superseded."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 449.58 0)
