		(uuid "bfe105b3-5dcf-5f93-b627-92becb0d3f3b")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-28 CUT-DRIVER LATCH TOPOLOGY AND ITS PART -- ADR-051 s2.5.1 mandates a LATCHED one-shot with a persistent NVS fired flag per channel plus a hardware series arming gate, but names no part: the IRLML2502 in the repo's own precedent is the switch, not the latch.  U_CUT1..U_CUT4 are PROVISION symbols whose pin set (VSCAP / GND / the wing RF_FEED line) is fixed and whose internals are TODO(unverified), as are the sense divider (OPEN-25), the on-time cap and the inter-cut interval.  Also open: the trigger mode - ground-commanded vs automatic (ADR-051 s2.5.7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 453.39 0)
		(effects
